<article class="article">
  <div class="article-body">
    <p><strong>{{ site.name }}</strong> is an independent, social-first news page from {{ site.city }}. We started on Instagram and Facebook with a simple goal: bring the news of Hyderabad, Telangana and the wider Deccan to people where they already are — quickly, clearly and in plain language.</p>
    <p>This website is the home for our full stories. Here you can read beyond the caption, find older reports by section, and share any story with friends and family on WhatsApp, Facebook or X in one tap.</p>
    <h2>What we cover</h2>
    <p>City news from Hyderabad and Secunderabad, Telangana and Andhra Pradesh politics and development, national and world headlines, sports, entertainment and business — with an eye on what matters to readers in the Deccan.</p>
    <h2>Our promise</h2>
    <p>We check before we post. When we get something wrong, we correct it openly. If you spot an error or have a news tip, please <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>
